==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*5 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 1~6 seconds<sup>30f~180f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Wall Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is optimized for level 12 units. If you struggle, it may be worth waiting for earlier stages to become available and clearing those first.

Due to the infinite Pengs, attempting to clear this stage very early on (level 2-4 cats) is not recommended without the use of [[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge Immune]] Ubers.

